{
  "name": "alloptical_half_adder",
  "description": "All-optical half adder in a single chi(2) crystal (published PPLN scheme): A (1064 nm) and B (1550 nm) lasers are overlapped and sent through one quasi-phase-matched PPLN waveguide. CARRY = the 631 nm sum-frequency light (A AND B). SUM = the residual infrared: with matched photon fluxes and strong conversion, both inputs are nearly fully depleted when both are on, so the leftover IR is bright for exactly one input and dim for both (A XOR B). Default state is 1 + 1 = 10.",
